        <p data-dc-tpl="304" style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--muted); margin: 0px 0px 26px; max-width: 520px; text-wrap: pretty;">The extension checks the page you are on and keeps its score in the toolbar. Quiet on a healthy site; a clear, readable warning when a real risk appears — with the reason attached, so you can decide for yourself.</p>
